  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in oil export throughput through the strait tends to lower regional spot fuel and feedstock costs, reducing production and transport expenses for US firms and thereby easing corporate margin pressure.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_conflict</data>
