  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising real yields increase firms' inflation‑adjusted financing costs and required returns, directly compressing corporate margins through higher interest expenses and tighter financing conditions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_bond_market_tension</data>
  <data key="d39">us_trade_unilateralism</data>
</edge>
