  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Large reflows out of European assets into US fixed income create funding stress and adverse FX moves for European banks and treasuries, constraining their ability to finance coordinated military/economic support and producing policy divergence among allies.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_bond_market_tension</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
