  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid rise in global oil prices raises headline inflation and inflation expectations, causing markets to repriced expected central bank tightening and a higher policy rate path.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_energy_reorder</data>
  <data key="d39">us_bond_market_tension</data>
