  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid increases in oil prices raise the strategic and economic returns to disrupting tanker traffic (to extract concessions, drive market moves, or profit via insurance/illicit sales), incentivizing Iranian forces or proxies to harass or interdict transits.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
